    "searchText": "uwc's hiring refuelers ship_refueling_intro_nyx united wayfarers club careercontract standing refuel pickup: stanton, pyro, nyx hey!\n\ndd from the united wayfarers club here.\n\nthe uwc offers repair, rearming and refueling services across the uee. it just so happens that we're on the look-out for new affiliates whose ships are fitted for refueling. if you've got the fuel pods and like it when people are pleased to see you, the uwc might be the club for you.\n\nand if you think it might be, i've got a live beacon you might like.\n\nif you do happen to like it, a word to the wise: make sure your fuel pods are full before you head out.\n\na club member has run out of ~misssion(fueltype) at [location]. i'm not sure on the details, like how they ended up out there with no go juice, but the uwc doesn't like to leave folk hanging.\n\nthe client vessel will pay you at the rate of [refuelrequest]. as a united wayfarers club contractor, you will also qualify for the uwc service fee listed above upon completion.\n\nit's a straightforward run. perfect if you want to get a feel for this kind of job. get out there, fill up the tanks of their [ship] and get them on their way. do enough runs like this, and the process becomes muscle memory. until then, there's a journal entry on your mobiglas called \"refueling protocols\" that covers the basics.\n\nthere have been no reports of outlaw activity in that sector, but stay alert. i always recommend you aim for a fast turnaround. the sooner you're done, the sooner i can fix you up with another contract. uwc's always looking for new affiliates. \n\nlooking forward to working with you.\n\ndina deloit\ndispatch hub\nunited wayfarers club\n\"we’ve got your back\" 0ada3f08-3f76-46ec-96e2-fc0f856b8eeb 66f31bca-1961-47f7-a4af-f7392271b15c 68667545-1978-4dbf-95e7-8fcdc03d017e standing +200 credits formula unresolved completion tag"
